{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Tiefling\n\nOne of your ancestors was a barbed devil or other spiky fiend. Barbs protrude from your head. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- Increase your Constitution or Charisma score by 1, up to a maximum of 20.\n\n- You gain proficiency in the Intimidation skill. If you\u0027re already proficient in it, your proficiency bonus is doubled for any check you make with it. You can use your Constitution instead of your Charisma for Intimidation (Charisma) checks.\n\n- As a bonus action, you can cause small barbs to protrude all over your body or cause them to retract. At the start of each of your turns while the barbs are out, you deal twice your proficiency bonus as piercing damage to any creature grappling you, in contact with you or any creature grappled by you.\n\n- While your barbs are out, you add your proficiency bonus as extra piercing damage for the damage rolls of your unarmed strikes. In addition you deal 1d6 piercing damage with your unarmed strikes instead of the normal amount.","level":1}],"id":"Custom841154b2-6068-40f5-b6ab-d5072b36693b","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Barbed Hide [SM] [R]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}